+## Routes
+
+All routes are listed under Routes in `README.md`.
+
+- `POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }`. Each row sells a positive whole number of portions. Previously imported tickets are skipped. The response counts newly imported tickets and individual dishes as `{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }`. A bad row or insufficient stock rejects the entire file.
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array of `{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }`, in item ID order. Dates are inclusive UTC days; difference is actual minus theoretical. Theoretical quantities are captured at import time.
